# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceIgnoresForeignHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance ignores the foreignHigh reported to it, so it passes another activation's record
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
\* MUTATION: no foreignHigh bound.
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
--- END
